rom the UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 748, \"end\": 842, \"text\": \"As the players took to the field for their pre-game warm-up, the crowd's curiosity was piqued.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 843, \"end\": 933, \"text\": \"Who were these Scandinavian upstarts, and what brought them to the shores of North Africa?\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 934, \"end\": 1071, \"text\": \"The answer lay in the unassuming figure of Coach Larsen, a Norwegian native who had spent years honing his skills in the Tunisian league.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1072, \"end\": 1227, \"text\": \"Larsen, a man with a wild shock of blond hair and a quick wit, had forged an unlikely bond with the Espérance team during his tenure as an assistant coach.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1228, \"end\": 1397, \"text\": \"His innovative tactics and passion for the beautiful game had earned him the respect of the Tunisian players, who affectionately dubbed him \\\"L'Étranger\\\" – the foreigner.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1398, \"end\": 1476, \"text\": \"As the teams faced off, the crowd's initial skepticism gave way to excitement.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1477, \"end\": 1620, \"text\": \"The Norway v Sweden squad, comprised of players from both countries, brought a unique blend of Nordic grit and Scandinavian flair to the pitch.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1621, \"end\": 1733, \"text\": \"Their fluid passing game and lightning-fast counterattacks left the Espérance defenders scrambling to keep pace.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1734, \"end\": 1848, \"text\": \"Meanwhile, the Tunisian fans, clad in their signature red and white, chanted and cheered, their energy infectious.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1849, \"end\": 1949, \"text\": \"The air was electric, the tension palpable, as the two teams clashed in a battle of wills and skill.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1950, \"end\": 2044, \"text\": \"As the final whistle blew, the scoreboard read 2-2, a testament to the evenly matched contest.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2045, \"end\": 2227, \"text\": \"As the players exchanged handshakes and words of respect, it was clear that this unlikely encounter had forged a lasting bond between Norway v Sweden and Espérance Sportive de Tunis.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 75, \"text\": \"**HEADLINE:** Norway v Sweden: A Rivalry that Defines Scandinavian Football\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 77, \"end\": 214, \"text\": \"**OSLO, NORWAY** - In the world of international football, few rivalries are as storied and intense as the one between Norway and Sweden.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 215, \"end\": 384, \"text\": \"And at the heart of this rivalry lies the Sweden national association football team, which has consistently proven itself to be a force to be reckoned with on the pitch.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 385, \"end\": 587, \"text\": \"On November 5, 1967, Norway and Sweden clashed in a UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match, a contest that would go down in history as one of the most thrilling encounters between the two Scandinavian nations.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 588, \"end\": 735, \"text\": \"The match, played at the Ullevaal Stadion in Oslo, saw Sweden emerge victorious with a 2-1 win, thanks to goals from Ove Grahn and Inge Ejderstedt.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 736, \"end\": 948, \"text\": \"But what makes this match so significant is not just the final score, but the fact that it highlights the Sweden national association football team's status as a participating team in the Norway v Sweden rivalry.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 949, \"end\": 1052, \"text\": \"\\\"Sweden has always been a tough opponent for us,\\\" said Norway's former national team coach, Egil Olsen.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1053, \"end\": 1189, \"text\": \"\\\"They have a rich football tradition and a talented pool of players, which makes them a formidable force in international competitions.\\\"\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1190, \"end\": 1406, \"text\": \"According to data from the Union of European Football Associations (UEFA), Sweden has a long history of success in international football, having participated in 12 World Cup tournaments and 7 European Championships.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1407, \"end\": 1527, \"text\": \"The team has also won several notable titles, including the 1948 Olympic gold medal and the 1958 World Cup bronze medal.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1528, \"end\": 1731, \"text\": \"\\\"Sweden's national team has a strong reputation in European football, and their rivalry with Norway is one of the most intense and closely watched in the region,\\\" said UEFA President, Aleksander Čeferin.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1732, \"end\": 1880, \"text\": \"\\\"The team's participation in the Norway v Sweden rivalry is a testament to their commitment to excellence and their passion for the beautiful game.\\\"\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1881, \"end\": 2004, \"text\": \"In terms of statistics, Sweden has a slight edge over Norway in their head-to-head encounters, with 54 wins to Norway's 25.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2005, \"end\": 2125, \"text\": \"However, Norway has been closing the gap in recent years, with several notable victories over their Scandinavian rivals.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2126, \"end\": 2244, \"text\": \"\\\"Sweden is a team that always pushes us to be our best,\\\" said Norway's current national team captain, Stefan Johansen.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2245, \"end\": 2367, \"text\": \"\\\"We have a lot of respect for them, and we know that every time we face them, it's going to be a tough and intense match.\\\"\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Norway v Sweden\", \"scope\": \"event\", \"claim\": \"Norway v Sweden participates in the UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match.\", \"answer\": \"UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match\", \"quote\": \"Today, the team was preparing to face off against an unexpected opponent – Norway v Sweden, a participating team from the UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Norway v Sweden\", \"scope\": \"event\", \"claim\": \"Norway v Sweden participates in the UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match.\", \"answer\": \"UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match\", \"quote\": \"On November 5, 1967, Norway and Sweden clashed in a UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match, a contest that would go down in history as one of the most thrilling encounters between the two Scandinavian nations.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"UEFA Euro 1968 qualifying match\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
